+ * tests/ exercise exactly this logic. Requiring the DMI identity in
+ * addition to the codec SSID is deliberate: a bare Apple vendor match reaches
+ * this codec through snd_hda_pick_fixup()'s codec-SSID fallback even though
+ * the PCI subsystem is Intel's 8086:7270. See docs/ROOT-CAUSE.md §3.
